  "content": "\n\n<h2>EffectTimerPlus</h2>\n<p>为状态效果图标添加强度指示器和倒计时叠加层。</p>\n<h3>关于</h3>\n<p>EffectTimerPlus 灵感来源于 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fT9FDHbY5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Status Effect Timer</a>，但更注重\n自定义功能。</p>\n<h3>功能特性</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>可完全调节的文字颜色和透明度</li>\n<li>可选文字阴影</li>\n<li>可选且可调的文字背景</li>\n<li>8 种文字位置选项</li>\n<li>可选的低时间警告颜色和闪烁效果</li>\n<li>可选择分别禁用任一指示器</li>\n<li>可选择在环境（信标）效果上隐藏计时器</li>\n<li>缩放选项：可更改效果图标的尺寸</li>\n<li>缩放选项：可根据效果图标的比例调整文字大小</li>\n</ul>\n<img alt=\"展示\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TerminalMC/EffectTimerPlus/HEAD/assets/images/showcase/effects.png\" width=\"500\">\n<h3>依赖项</h3>\n<p>Fabric：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fP7dR8mSH%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmOgUt4GM\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252f1eAoo2KR\" rel=\"nofollow\">YACL</a></p>\n<p>NeoForge：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252f1eAoo2KR\" rel=\"nofollow\">YACL</a></p>\n<h3>兼容性</h3>\n<p>缩放选项有时可能会与其他模组产生冲突。如果遇到相关问题，请在 Discord 或 GitHub 上反馈。</p>\n<h3>致谢</h3>\n<p>EffectTimerPlus 最初是在 <a href=\"https://github.com/magicus/statuseffecttimer\" rel=\"nofollow\">Status Effect Timer</a>\n由 <a href=\"https://github.com/magicus\" rel=\"nofollow\">magicus</a> 制作的基础上进行的更新。</p>\n<h3>许可证</h3>\n<p>EffectTimerPlus 继承了来自 Status Effect Timer 的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.gnu.org%252flicenses%252flgpl-3.0.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">LGPL-3.0-only</a> 许可证。</p>\n<h3>联系方式</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terminalmc.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1103153365216669797?logo=discord&label=Discord Server&color=#5865F2\" alt=\"Discord 服务器\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/TerminalMC/EffectTimerPlus/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/TerminalMC/EffectTimerPlus?logo=github&label=GitHub Issues\" alt=\"GitHub 问题反馈\"></a></p>",
